# Example characterization/{survey}/pointings.list (OSSSSim getsur.f95 formats).
# Every line ends with: JD fill observer {block}.eff
#   observer: a JPL Horizons vector CSV in this directory, or an MPC code.
#   {block}.eff: lines with the same .eff are tiles of one block.
#
# Rectangle: on-sky width and height [deg], then RA Dec (decimal or h:m:s d:m:s).
